7 cumulative input tokens\n- ephemeral: 6/6 exact submissions; 136,473 cumulative input tokens\n- persistent: 6/6 exact submissions; 56,403 cumulative input tokens\n- all releases verified; zero old-target pointer admissions\n- persistent task-4 invalidation refused the old handle and repair succeeded\n- persistent input and planner-generation gates passed by task 6\n\nThe JSON summary is intentionally additive and does not overwrite prior raw results or closed-issue evidence. The broker records actual `codex exec --json` usage instead of synthetic zero usage and passes the supplied contract/schema to the model boundary.\n\nCloses the experimental recording portion of #2558; follow-up integration/cleanup can be reviewed separately.","created_at":"2026-09-19T19:08:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T19:47:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-19T19:08:11Z","merged_at":"2026-09-19T19:08:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"13d0ccbf2559cc1f70aa2652497ae941ceb13eb7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unjuno/agent-interface/pulls/2962/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unjuno/agent-interface/pulls/2962/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unjuno/agent-interface/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unjuno/agent-interface/issues/2962/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unjuno/agent-interface/statuses/748fb2f654df2414f48f96d715ce989b94940f9c","head":{"label":"Unjuno:research/2558-formal-docker-integrated-20260920","ref":"research/2558-formal-docker-integrated-20260920","sha":"748fb2f654df2414f48f96d715ce989b94940f9c","user":{"login":"Unjuno","id":241447786,"node_id":"U_kgDODmQzag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241447786?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unjuno","html_url":"https://github.com/Unjuno","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/